cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it implements."
title: "tsdml: Double Machine Learning for Time Series in Python"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-28
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/merwanroudane/tsdml"
url: "https://github.com/merwanroudane/tsdml"
abstract: >-
  A Python implementation of Reverse Cross-Fitting Double Machine Learning for
  macroeconomic time series, with Goldilocks-zone tuning of nuisance
  hyperparameters, DML local projections, HAC inference, conditional-stability
  diagnostics and publication-quality figures and tables.
keywords:
  - double machine learning
  - causal inference
  - time series
  - cross-fitting
  - local projections
  - econometrics
